      "text": "Trigger-body foreign-key processing has no regression test, and an outer write without relevant keys passes `false` into the closure even with foreign keys enabled, so a body inserting into `c(x REFERENCES missing)` misses SQLite’s prepare error. Fix: pass the connection setting into the closure and add a regression for this case."
    },
    {
      "id": "20261021T095649Z-15d3e144#2",
