      "severity": "must",
      "text": "Trigger-row resolution lacks tests for affinity and collation, allowing `NEW.a = '1'` on an INTEGER column to resolve differently from SQLite and DELETE-trigger `OLD` references to lose their column collation. Fix: add native-oracle regressions and correct metadata lookup for trigger cells and omitted row slots."
    },
    {
